# Fast verification (default)

Use headless terminal checks only. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) tiers and [.cursorrules](../../.cursorrules) for full command matrix.

## Default commands

- Single file: `npx vitest run path/to/file.test.ts` or `npm run test:file -- path/to/file.test.ts`
- Typecheck: `npm run typecheck`
- Tier 1: touched file(s) or `npm run test:changed`
- Tier 2: `npm run test:core` or `npm run test:scripts`
- Tier 3 only: `npm run test` + `npm run build`

## Forbidden unless user explicitly asks

- Browser MCP loops (`browser_navigate`, screenshots, visual QA)
- `npm run dev` / `npm run preview` for verification
- `mockups:capture`, `composite:render`, `post:create`, video/reel scripts
- Full suite or production build for localized edits
- `npm install` when `node_modules` exists and lockfile unchanged

## Allowed when requested

Visual QA, mockup capture, browser checks, or skill-driven media pipelines the user invoked.
